{"study_accession":"PRJNA563915","secondary_study_accession":"SRP220372","title":"The impact of stanniocalcin 1 on the transcriptome of human cord blood stem/progenitors","description":"Purpose: Stanniocalcin 1 (STC1) is a secreted glycoprotein expressed in mesenchymal stroma cells (MSCs). STC1 expression is upregulated in response to acute myeloid leukemia (AML) co-culture. Recombinant STC1 has proliferation limiting effects on human hematopoietic stem/progenitors cells (HSPCs) and facilitiates the preservation of HSCs ex vivo. We hope to gain insight into the mechanism by exploring the transcriptome of stem/progenitors exposed to STC1. Overall design: Human umbilical cord blood CD34+CD38- HSPCs and CD34+CD38+ hematopoietic progenitors cells (HPCs) from three independent donors were FACS-isolated and independently co-cultured on bone marrow MSCs in myelocult H5100 media supplemented with 100 ng/ml STC1 or PBS as control. After 48h HSPCs, HPCs and MSCs were FACS-sorted into lysis buffer.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":18,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN12695140","study_accession":"PRJNA563915","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"MSC_Stanniocalcin_1","description":"MSC_Stanniocalcin_1","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4060367","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2019-09-06","attributes":[["source_name","MSC"],["tissue","Bone marrow"],["phenotype","CD45-CD90+"],["treatment","Stanniocalcin 1"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR10068997","experiment_accession":"SRX6802631","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 4000","read_count":2583466,"base_count":196343416,"first_public":"2019-09-06","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 4000 sequencing: GSM4060367: MSC_Stanniocalcin_1 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN12695141","study_accession":"PRJNA563915","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"MSC_vehicle